      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>给定 <span class=\"katex math inline\">n</span> 个正整数 <span class=\"katex math inline\">a_i</span>，请你输出这些数的乘积的约数和，答案对 <span class=\"katex math inline\">10^9+7</span> 取余数。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
